OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few showers around first
OL,6,Fthing on Thursday, mostly in the
OL,7,Fnorth, but these will quickly fade
OL,8,Fleaving a largely dry day with sunny
OL,9,Fspells. Lighter winds across the
OL,10,Fregion with temperatures around the
OL,11,Fseasonal average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FOvernight will see some
OL,14,Fpatchy cloud and mostly clear spells
OL,15,Facross the region. A cool night and
OL,16,Fcomfortable night across the region.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
