OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FAny patchy cloud during the
OL,6,Fmorning will lift and break, leaving a
OL,7,Fdry and sunny day for all. Sunshine
OL,8,Fmay be hazy at times but it'll feel
OL,9,Fwarm.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA dry
OL,12,Fstart to the weekend, with sunny
OL,13,Fspells the odd shower by Sunday.
OL,14,FTurning warm on Saturday, but
OL,15,Ftemperatures will slowly decrease into
OL,16,Fnext week.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
